    VALUES were renamed when the rail moved from domain-based modes to
    object-type ones — a returning visitor can still be holding a legacy
    'dfir'/'it' string. Anything unrecognized falls back to the
    server-rendered `data-default-mode` rather than rendering an empty rail.
